♪I rule my whole own whirl♪

9
00:00:53,010 --> 00:00:58,480
(XiA 89988)

10
00:01:17,239 --> 00:01:18,200
You're not driving?

11
00:01:22,959 --> 00:01:24,519
Let's finish what we started

12
00:01:24,519 --> 00:01:25,439
last time.

13
00:01:49,690 --> 00:01:50,653
=Quite The Girl=

14
00:01:50,660 --> 00:01:51,760
(Adapted from the Tomato Novel
"Quite the Girl.")

15
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:52,290
(Author: Wo Shafei Kuxin)

16
00:01:52,290 --> 00:01:53,706
=Episode 6=

17
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:00,159
What?

18
00:02:01,799 --> 00:02:03,400
I have a deal for you.

19
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:16,840
Don't tell me you leaked the bid

20
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:19,280
just for Mr. Qin's opinion.

21
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:24,479
The restaurant fire...

22
00:02:24,719 --> 00:02:25,560
You started it.

23
00:02:26,479 --> 00:02:28,400
The fire isn't what matters.

24
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:31,000
It's Uncle's anger.

25
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:31,680
Guess...

26
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:33,199
What will he do to you?

27
00:02:37,159 --> 00:02:38,840
Lu Mingyu, what do you want?

28
00:02:40,639 --> 00:02:42,639
I want Grandma treated.

29
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:45,919
Let me be clear.

30
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:46,840
I'm human,

31
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:48,479
not a wishing well.

32
00:02:48,759 --> 00:02:50,360
Say something I can do.

33
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:53,400
You stole the bid under Uncle's nose.

34
00:02:53,919 --> 00:02:55,280
You can just as easily

35
00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:56,439
sneak a doctor in.

36
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:58,680
Even if I could,

37
00:02:59,080 --> 00:03:00,599
I can't enter Grandma's room.

38
00:03:11,879 --> 00:03:12,840
Lu Mingyu.

39
00:03:13,479 --> 00:03:15,080
You're ambitious.

40
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:17,319
If Grandma isn't cured,

41
00:03:17,919 --> 00:03:20,319
or anything goes wrong,

42
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:22,319
these photos

43
00:03:22,319 --> 00:03:24,240
will go straight to Uncle.

44
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:25,400
I mean it.

45
00:03:56,039 --> 00:03:56,800
Lu Lin...

46
00:03:57,199 --> 00:03:58,560
Lu Lin, what's wrong?

47
00:03:59,599 --> 00:04:01,599
Get Dr. Gao right now, Butler!

48
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:05,879
Mr. Lu.

49
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:08,280
How's Lu Lin?

50
00:04:08,439 --> 00:04:09,960
He's taken his meds and fallen asleep.

51
00:04:10,039 --> 00:04:11,439
What's wrong with him?

52
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:13,319
He has a severe infection.

53
00:04:13,319 --> 00:04:14,319
A dirty disease.

54
00:04:14,599 --> 00:04:16,600
The blood is from low immunity.

55
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:17,360
It's a complication.

56
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:21,600
While he recovers,

57
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:23,240
put him
in the back courtyard's west wing.

58
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:24,959
Okay.

59
00:04:25,319 --> 00:04:25,920
Don't worry.

60
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:27,680
I'll watch him closely.

61
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:29,079
If he makes it through

62
00:04:29,079 --> 00:04:30,519
the next 48 hours,

63
00:04:30,519 --> 00:04:32,120
his condition can be controlled.

64
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:34,959
Thanks. Go care for him.

65
00:04:35,079 --> 00:04:35,439
Okay.

66
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:58,360
(After two days)

67
00:04:58,360 --> 00:04:59,759
(of monitoring her condition,)

68
00:05:00,399 --> 00:05:01,079
(I'm fairly sure)

69
00:05:01,079 --> 00:05:02,480
(she's in the early stage.)

70
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:04,279
(Medication can control it.)

71
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:05,839
(I've put the meds)

72
00:05:05,959 --> 00:05:07,720
(into her drinking water.)

73
00:05:08,199 --> 00:05:09,920
(She'll be fine for now.)

74
00:05:24,519 --> 00:05:25,240
Bro.

75
00:05:25,319 --> 00:05:26,279
I heard you weren't feeling well,

76
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:27,560
so I came to check on you.

77
00:05:28,199 --> 00:05:28,720
Thanks.

78
00:05:31,639 --> 00:05:32,160
Mingyu.

79
00:05:44,279 --> 00:05:45,360
We have a guest.

80
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:46,360
Say hello at least.

81
00:05:47,319 --> 00:05:48,800
This is Mr. Qin.

82
00:05:52,439 --> 00:05:53,120
I've got places to be.

83
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:54,240
Excuse me.

84
00:05:59,879 --> 00:06:00,600
Ignore her.

85
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:01,920
She's always like this.

86
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:02,800
Spoiled.

87
00:06:03,079 --> 00:06:03,959
No manners.

88
00:06:04,199 --> 00:06:05,120
Rude to everyone.

89
00:06:05,839 --> 00:06:06,639
Who's that?

90
00:06:06,759 --> 00:06:07,680
My cousin.

91
00:06:07,879 --> 00:06:08,639
Lu Mingyu.

92
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:11,279
Bro.

93
00:06:12,519 --> 00:06:13,839
Can I ask you something?

94
00:06:17,079 --> 00:06:19,199
Quit messing around all day.

95
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:20,759
There's an art show soon.

96
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:22,439
The who's who of Xizi City's

97
00:06:22,439 --> 00:06:24,079
art scene will be there.

98
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:25,399
Get ready. You'll represent

99
00:06:25,879 --> 00:06:26,680
the Lu family.

100
00:06:27,839 --> 00:06:29,120
(The painting money)

101
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:31,600
(only covers tuition and travel.)

102
00:06:32,319 --> 00:06:34,519
(But I still have
Grandma's medical bills to pay.)

103
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:37,360
(This art show)

104
00:06:37,920 --> 00:06:39,839
(might help me network)

105
00:06:40,519 --> 00:06:41,800
(for future sales.)

106
00:06:42,399 --> 00:06:43,040
Okay.

107
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:44,279
I'll go.

108
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:49,240
Show what you can do.

109
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:51,000
We raised you all these years.

110
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:52,720
Time to pay it back.

111
00:07:09,199 --> 00:07:10,720
(Duan Xiuming: Baby, date night!)

112
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:13,959
(Lu Mingyu: Busy. At the art show.)

113
00:07:16,199 --> 00:07:17,600
(Duan Xiuming: Send your location. Now.)

114
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:23,240
Hi, Miss Lu.

115
00:07:24,120 --> 00:07:25,120
Thanks for coming.

116
00:07:25,439 --> 00:07:27,040
I'm the organizer.

117
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:28,279
Qin Lian.

118
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:33,000
Hi, Mr. Qin.

119
00:07:37,319 --> 00:07:38,920
Our brief meeting at the Lus'

120
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:41,480
has stayed with me.

121
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:42,399
Come.

122
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:43,279
Miss Lu.

123
00:07:43,720 --> 00:07:44,120
This way.

124
00:07:57,959 --> 00:07:59,279
Distinguished guests,

125
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:03,480
Thank you for joining us tonight

126
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:05,120
for this art showcase,

127
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:06,759
hosted by the Qin Group.

128
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:08,439
I'm honored

129
00:08:08,439 --> 00:08:09,800
to introduce

130
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:13,040
a rising star in Xizi City's art scene,

131
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:14,839
Miss Lu Mingyu.

132
00:08:14,959 --> 00:08:17,199
Her art is full of spirit and power.

133
00:08:17,199 --> 00:08:19,040
Her future is bright.

134
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:27,199
I also hope

135
00:08:27,199 --> 00:08:29,720
you'll all keep an eye

136
00:08:29,720 --> 00:08:33,279
on this beauty with talent.

137
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:34,080
Now,

138
00:08:34,639 --> 00:08:35,960
I hope you all have

139
00:08:36,159 --> 00:08:37,639
a wonderful evening.

140
00:08:38,039 --> 00:08:38,960
(- Thanks.)
- Thanks!

141
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:43,159
Mr. Qin.

142
00:08:43,559 --> 00:08:44,960
Thanks for the intro.

143
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:45,960
Mingyu.

144
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:47,240
This show

145
00:08:47,519 --> 00:08:49,519
was all prepared for you.

146
00:08:49,759 --> 00:08:51,960
After tonight, Xizi's art scene

147
00:08:51,960 --> 00:08:53,960
will know your name,

148
00:08:55,080 --> 00:08:56,480
and mine

149
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:58,879
will be linked to yours.

150
00:08:59,360 --> 00:09:00,360
If you say yes,

151
00:09:00,799 --> 00:09:03,279
connections, fame, and wealth

152
00:09:03,440 --> 00:09:05,080
will all be yours.

153
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:09,000
Even me.

154
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:11,039
I'd be yours too.

155
00:09:18,039 --> 00:09:19,720
You're too generous, Mr. Qin.

156
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:21,399
I don't even know how to repay you.

157
00:09:22,840 --> 00:09:23,559
How about...

158
00:09:24,080 --> 00:09:25,679
I paint your portrait?

159
00:09:27,240 --> 00:09:29,120
One no one will forget.

160
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:32,559
I'd be honored.

161
00:09:50,879 --> 00:09:51,559
Done.

162
00:09:59,559 --> 00:10:00,879
What do you think?

163
00:10:01,159 --> 00:10:02,519
Abstract expressionism.

164
00:10:07,039 --> 00:10:08,559
I think it's spot-on.

165
00:10:14,960 --> 00:10:15,720
Funny?

166
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:17,159
I asked, is it funny?

167
00:10:20,039 --> 00:10:20,879
Lu Mingyu.

168
00:10:22,200 --> 00:10:23,519
You've got nerve.

169
00:10:23,919 --> 00:10:25,080
You dare mock me?

170
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:28,080
Do you know who runs Xizi?

171
00:10:28,879 --> 00:10:31,159
You'll regret this!

172
00:10:44,639 --> 00:10:45,759
My arm...

173
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:49,720
Now it's even better.

174
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:51,600
It really captures the essence.

175
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:52,679
You...

176
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:56,200
My arm...

177
00:11:01,879 --> 00:11:03,200
While I was away,

178
00:11:03,480 --> 00:11:05,279
you had flies buzzing around.

179
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:08,039
Guess I'll be your full-time flyswatter.

180
00:11:08,559 --> 00:11:09,919
I'll swat them all.

181
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:13,360
Not at all.

182
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:16,799
I barely went out before I met you.

183
00:11:17,600 --> 00:11:18,399
I was a good girl.

184
00:11:22,240 --> 00:11:24,440
So I corrupted you?

185
00:11:24,639 --> 00:11:25,960
Now I'm curious.

186
00:11:26,759 --> 00:11:28,360
For someone like me...

187
00:11:28,879 --> 00:11:30,120
what do I mean to you?

188
00:11:51,440 --> 00:11:54,226
♪Your existence's beyond all belief♪

189
00:11:55,640 --> 00:11:58,653
♪Can't take my eyes off you, release♪

190
00:11:59,840 --> 00:12:02,986
♪Your gaze, your breath,
they trap my soul♪

191
00:12:03,540 --> 00:12:07,080
♪No escape, no place to hide,
no control♪

192
00:12:08,040 --> 00:12:09,946
♪I break all rules for your♪

193
00:12:10,460 --> 00:12:11,933
♪Rare pride♪

194
00:12:12,300 --> 00:12:13,893
♪Your lonely edge♪

195
00:12:14,140 --> 00:12:15,866
♪Lights up my side♪

196
00:12:16,440 --> 00:12:19,960
♪I'm wrapped around you, deep inside♪

197
00:12:20,280 --> 00:12:24,693
♪Drowning in you, no way to hide♪

198
00:12:25,060 --> 00:12:26,880
♪Baby, you deserve it♪

199
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:29,039
Don't move.

200
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:33,066
♪You're the perfect one I seek♪

201
00:12:33,280 --> 00:12:37,000
♪Stare at me, tell me you need me♪

202
00:12:37,660 --> 00:12:40,080
♪Baby, you deserve it♪

203
00:12:42,060 --> 00:12:43,853
♪Baby, you deserve it♪

204
00:12:46,100 --> 00:12:49,800
♪You're the perfect one I seek♪

205
00:12:50,300 --> 00:12:53,813
♪All my world's meant for you to keep♪

206
00:12:54,180 --> 00:12:58,013
♪Keep every piece,
every breath for you deep♪

207
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:15,573
♪Mild face covers all my pride♪

208
00:13:16,020 --> 00:13:18,200
♪Quiet breath hides my sharp mind♪

209
00:13:19,020 --> 00:13:21,200
♪Bearing hurt, I stand aside♪

210
00:13:21,700 --> 00:13:24,080
♪Save my strength to turn the tide♪

211
00:13:25,060 --> 00:13:27,000
♪No savior comes to light my way♪

212
00:13:28,040 --> 00:13:30,160
♪I carve my path through dark grey♪

213
00:13:30,840 --> 00:13:33,560
♪All disguise I keep in sight♪

214
00:13:33,840 --> 00:13:36,506
♪Wait the chance to win the fight♪

215
00:13:37,220 --> 00:13:38,613
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

216
00:13:38,920 --> 00:13:41,600
♪Calm but full of pearl♪

217
00:13:42,800 --> 00:13:44,586
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

218
00:13:45,460 --> 00:13:48,373
♪I rule my whole own whirl♪

219
00:13:49,700 --> 00:13:52,413
♪Break the chain, erase the curl♪

220
00:13:52,840 --> 00:13:55,400
♪I rise up with my inner pearl♪

221
00:13:55,660 --> 00:13:58,226
♪Self-rescue fire burning full♪

222
00:13:58,840 --> 00:13:59,786
♪I'm the master of my rule♪

223
00:14:28,040 --> 00:14:32,413
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

224
00:14:35,160 --> 00:14:38,733
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

225
00:14:42,120 --> 00:14:46,640
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

226
00:14:47,900 --> 00:14:52,800
♪Chimes and cicadas have loved so long♪

227
00:14:55,440 --> 00:15:01,640
♪A love letter written in song♪

228
00:15:02,200 --> 00:15:06,893
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

229
00:15:09,520 --> 00:15:15,506
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

230
00:15:16,280 --> 00:15:21,853
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

231
00:15:22,740 --> 00:15:29,480
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

232
00:15:30,540 --> 00:15:32,560
♪Close your eyes and count♪

233
00:15:32,840 --> 00:15:36,901
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

